---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for Math Solution & Exam Center Mymensingh.">

  <section class="gradient-bg">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto section-padding text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto card p-8 lg:p-10 space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Admission & Enrollment</h2>
        <p>Admission to Math Solution &amp; Exam Center Mymensingh is confirmed upon submission of the online application, verification of previous academic records, and payment of the admission fee. The center reserves the right to decline any application.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. Fees & Payments</h2>
        <p>Monthly tuition fees must be paid by the 10th of each month. Late payments may incur a fine. Fees are non-refundable once a month has started, except in exceptional circumstances approved by the management.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. Attendance & Conduct</h2>
        <p>Students are expected to maintain at least 80% attendance. Mobile phones must be switched off during class. Any form of misconduct, cheating in exams, or damage to center property may lead to suspension or expulsion.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Online Exams</h2>
        <p>Online exams must be taken honestly within the allotted time. Each exam can be attempted once unless a retake is explicitly allowed. Results published on the portal are final, subject to review requests within 7 days.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Account Responsibility</h2>
        <p>Students are responsible for keeping their login credentials confidential. Any activity under a student's account is presumed to be performed by that student.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">6. Changes</h2>
        <p>Class schedules, routines, and fees may be revised with prior notice. Continued use of our services after such changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
        <p>Questions about these terms? <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700">Contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PublicLayout>
